{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226430","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222643001:1":{"text":"ど、どうもどうも。何かご用ですかい？こちとら清い商売しかしてない普通の商人でさあ……","source_cn":"诸、诸位，找我有什么事啊？我可是个本本分分的好商人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE9A67DC522AA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222643002:1":{"text":"あなたが普通の商人なら、ルカさんはさしずめブライト聖堂の聖騎士ですね。","source_cn":"你要是好商人，那卢卡就是耀光圣堂的圣骑士了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A27ED5F32778AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222643003:0":{"text":"ロンロンたちはソニアさんに頼まれて、あなたに会いに来たんです。","source_cn":"先生，我们是受索尼娅委托，专程来找你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560AAA97E85FF243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222643004:1":{"text":"ルカの旦那ならよく来やすが、ブラッディ・マリーのボスが自分に何の用です？","source_cn":"血薇帮的当家找我做什么……往常来找我的都是卢卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C998AD49683D47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222643005:1":{"text":"ルカさんは別の任務に出ています。あなたの情報網を見込んで、最近の出来事を色々教えて欲しいんです。","source_cn":"卢卡有他的任务。索尼娅很看重你的情报网，最近有什么风吹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48A1F4B06855E24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222643006:1":{"text":"ははっ、ラスティーアンカーじゃ毎日色んなことが起きてやすぜ。たとえば、ついさっきモーリんとこの鶏が死んだこととか……","source_cn":"呵呵，锈锚港每天发生的事情可太多了，比如老莫里家的鸡刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C69E5D87535179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222643007:1":{"text":"はぐらかさないでください。私たちが聞きたいのはもっと重要な情報です。","source_cn":"不要耍嘴皮子，你知道我们想听更重要的情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D5E94E6E8AF64D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222643008:1":{"text":"たとえば？","source_cn":"举个例子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FED6567165CDF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1222643008":{"text":"たとえば？","source_cn":"举个例子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FED6567165CDF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222643009:1":{"text":"港の封鎖が解かれた今、密航なんて危険で割に合わない商売、もう誰もやってませんよ。","source_cn":"血薇帮解除了海禁，谁会在这时做偷渡生意啊？没必要挣那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074C554227269CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222643011:1":{"text":"特に気になるところはないですね。","source_cn":"听上去没什么大问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3E6F5802C81756D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222643012:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンのアサシンが街に潜んでいるんです。その人が、港から出るための船を探している可能性があります。","source_cn":"有个亡灵杀手潜藏在锈锚港，她很可能在暗地寻找船只，偷渡离港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B2A0DD623398CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222643013:1":{"text":"なるほどね。自分もラスティーアンカーで生計を立ててる身なんでね、グレイヴボーンなんぞに暴れられちゃあ、商売あがったりだ。","source_cn":"我知道了，我也是靠着锈锚港吃饭的人，不会眼睁睁看着亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28337CD81B770609","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222643014:1":{"text":"親方や船長たちに互いを見張るよう伝えておきやす。密航なんて絶対にさせやしませんよ！","source_cn":"我会放话出去，让工头和船长们互相监督，看谁敢帮助亡灵偷渡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2403FE092FCABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222643015:1":{"text":"助かります。何か情報が入ったら、ブラッディ・マリーに言えば、報酬ははずむそうですよ。","source_cn":"很好，如果你有相关的线索，记得随时告诉血薇帮，报酬优厚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F3C556982967A11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222643016: